{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13716","headline":"和翰林吴舍人兄弟西斋 · 顾况","name":"和翰林吴舍人兄弟西斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家诚易知，易知复难同。\n新裁尺一诏，早入明光宫。\n西斋何其高，上与星汉通。\n永怀洞庭石，春色相玲珑。\n久怀巴峡泉，夜落君丝桐。\n信是怡神所，迢迢蔑华嵩。\n鸟飞晴云灭，叠嶂盘虚空。\n君家诚易知，易知意难穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}